shadow knight~
a Shadow Knight~
This armored soldier takes a swing at you!
~
This knight seems bathed in shadows. His armor is black as midnight and seems
to radiate a thick dark mist.  His eyes are a piercing red and he howls his
battlecry in the old tongue.  His armor is adorned in the skulls of his
victims.
~
