E
plaque faded~
This is the Trial of Fellowship.  Deep within these caverns are creatures that
have been sealed away.  You will face ancient beasts as well as horrid beast
that should never see the light of day again.  Yet, due to the cramped
quarters, only Two adventurers may venture in at once. This is a test of team
work, cooperation, and strength.  Let only the smart and mighty dare enter.
Only avatars are advised to enter.


-Nameless
~
